     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Fair disclosure: I posted this on SO: <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/27015311/shiny-app-gets-400-bad-request-trying-to-get-data-from-google-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/27015311/shiny-app-gets-400-bad-request-trying-to-get-data-from-google-api&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401324825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3D0cUENJNryaGwQOtNB0bJ\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/27015311/shiny-app-gets-400-bad-request-trying-to-get-data-from-google-api</a><div>but it seems like ther is not much traffic to my question.</div><div><p style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">As part of my shiny app I call <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13.6000003814697px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background:rgb(238,238,238)\">geocode()</code> from the <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13.6000003814697px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background:rgb(238,238,238)\">ggmap</code> R package. <br>The data is geocoded and gets a result - i can see that from my console trying to run the app locally and from the log on the <b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13.6000003814697px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401324825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PFrfC_JXFbpkd5x3EXJfN\">shinyapps.io</a></b> dash board.<br>After the end of the geocode i get the next message:<br></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:13.6000003814697px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.8048000335693px;background:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:inherit;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">.Warning </span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;color:rgb(0,0,139);background:transparent\">in</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\"> readLines</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">connect</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">:</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">\r\n  cannot open</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">:</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\"> HTTP status was </span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&#39;400 Bad Request&#39;</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">\r\nError </span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;color:rgb(0,0,139);background:transparent\">in</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\"> readLines</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">connect</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\">:</span><span style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;background:transparent\"> cannot open the connection  </span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">have a clue?</p><p style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Thanks </p><p style=\"font-size:13.6000003814697px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu San